// @title Two drum machines in one pattern
// @category drums
// @details One rhythm played by two drum machines at once: bank("[KorgDDM110, dmx]") stacks both,
//   so each hit is the two layered. A 16-step polymeter ({...}%8, twice as fast) keeps it moving.
// @tags percussion, electro, layering
// @by alienmind
// @credits DJ_Dave
s("{~ ~ rim ~ cp ~ rim cp ~!2 rim ~ cp ~}%8").bank("[KorgDDM110, dmx]")
  .fast(2).speed(1.1).gain(.5)
